交換を行いました。インド太平洋地域やウクライナ情勢について意見交換するとともに、日EU間、日NATO間の更なる連携、法 https://t.co/q8BxvCoP7T","id_str":"2110935962884923816","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":17,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"303730149"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/press/re…","expanded_url":"https://www.mofa.go.jp/mofaj/press/release/pressit_000001_04303.html","indices":[194,217],"url":"https://t.co/JCJwLq84FH"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMTA5MzU5NjI3Njc1NDQzMjA=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"船越外務事務次官は、ベルギー・ブリュッセルに出張し、カイサ・オロングレン欧州対外活動庁事務総長、ジェフリー・ファン＝レーウウェン北大西洋条約機構（NATO）首席補佐官と意見交換を行いました。インド太平洋地域やウクライナ情勢について意見交換するとともに、日EU間、日NATO間の更なる連携、法の支配に基づく自由で開かれた国際秩序の維持・強化に向けた連携を強化していくことで一致しました。\n\nhttps://t.co/JCJwLq84FH"}}},"rest_id":"2110935962884923816","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"8318","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2110935962884923816","sortIndex":"2111071115475419053"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"height":144,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2110090057243873280/TLWI4LoJ?format=jpg&name=144x144_2","width":144},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"domain","value":{"string_value":"www.mofa.go.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":420,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2110090057243873280/TLWI4LoJ?format=jpg&name=420x420_2","width":420},"type":"IMAGE"